      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do HydroSox come up big or small?",
            "answer": "<p>They run true to the foot-length sizes on the size guide, and they’re a close stretchy fit rather than a loose one. Between two sizes, take the bigger — going down grips your toes and is hard on the waterproof layer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do they come in different heights?",
            "answer": "<p>No. One height, crew, in every colour and size. Having one build is part of why they’re £20 and not £35.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are they unisex?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The sizes run from UK 3 to UK 14 and the sock is the same for everyone. Go by foot length rather than the men’s or women’s size you’re used to.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How many pairs do most people buy?",
            "answer": "<p>Two or three. They need washing and air drying between wears, and air drying takes longer than a tumble dryer, so one pair rarely keeps up with a daily problem.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I put them in the washing machine?",
            "answer": "<p>Cool wash, gentle cycle, inside out, no fabric softener and no bleach. Then air dry away from a radiator. Never tumble dry and never iron — both are heat straight onto the waterproof layer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What arrives in the parcel?",
            "answer": "<p>The pairs you chose, in the colour and size you picked. No boxes, no printed inserts. Keeping the packaging simple is part of what keeps postage out of the price.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
